### 3.1 CAN Expert Module (`CanExpertIDS`)

Maps to your [CanStudentTCN](file:///c:/ResearchAutoIDS/src/dpcr_ids/models/can_student.py):

- **Input**: Intercepts CAN frames from `FiCo4OMNeT` bus model
- **Windowing**: Buffers `window_size=100` frames with `stride=50` (matching your config)
- **Feature extraction**: Extracts the 16 features (`can_id`, `dlc`, `d0-d7`, `iat_same_id`, `payload_entropy`, etc.) in C++
- **Inference**: Loads `can_student.onnx` via ONNX Runtime C++ API, outputs logit + 128-d embedding
- **Output**: Sends `[1, 129]` tensor (logit + embedding) to the Fusion module

### 3.2 Ethernet Expert Module (`EthExpertIDS`)

Maps to your [EthStudentCNN](file:///c:/ResearchAutoIDS/src/dpcr_ids/models/eth_student.py):

- **Input**: Intercepts Ethernet frames from INET switch/tap
- **Image construction**: Buffers payloads into `[3, 32, 32]` tensor (matching your config)
- **Inference**: Loads `eth_student.onnx`, outputs logit + 128-d embedding
- **Output**: Sends `[1, 129]` tensor to Fusion module

### 3.3 Late Fusion Module (`FusionIDS`)

Maps to your [TinyLateFusionMetaModel](file:///c:/ResearchAutoIDS/src/dpcr_ids/models/late_fusion.py):

- **Input**: Receives `[2, 129]` stacked expert outputs
- **Inference**: Loads `fusion_student.onnx`, outputs fused logit
- **Output**: Passes calibrated probability to the Router

### 3.4 Confidence Router Module

Maps to your [ConfidenceRouter](file:///c:/ResearchAutoIDS/src/dpcr_ids/runtime/router.py):

- Pure C++ logic (no ML): `tau_low=0.15`, `tau_high=0.85`
- Routes to fast path (ATTACK/NORMAL) or heavy path (fallback/ESCALATE)

### 3.5 Decision Aggregator Module

Maps to your [DecisionAggregator](file:///c:/ResearchAutoIDS/src/dpcr_ids/runtime/aggregator.py):

- Time-bucketed merging (`bucket_ms=250`) using OMNeT++ simulation time (not wall clock)
- Priority-based decision: `NORMAL < ATTACK < ESCALATE`

### 3.6 Attacker ECU Modules

Custom traffic generators injecting the attack types from your datasets:

| Attack Type | OMNeT++ Implementation |
|-------------|----------------------|
| **DoS** | High-frequency CAN frame injection (flood `canplayer`-style) |
| **Fuzzy** | Random CAN ID + payload injection at variable rates |
