## 10. Verification Plan

### Automated Tests
- **Parity test**: Run the same 1000-sample trace through both Python replay and OMNeT++ simulation; assert identical detection decisions
- **Timing sanity**: Verify that simulated CAN frame inter-arrival times match real-world CAN bus specifications (e.g., ~500µs at 500kbit/s)
- **Build test**: Ensure the OMNeT++ project compiles and a 100-event smoke simulation completes without errors

### Simulation Experiments
- **Bus-load sweep**: 20%, 50%, 80% bus utilization → measure detection latency degradation
- **ECU scaling**: 5, 10, 20 ECUs → measure gateway throughput and IDS decision delay
- **Attack injection rate**: Vary attacker frame rate → measure detection accuracy vs. false positive rate
